<title>CROATIA: Croatian March real wages rise.</title>
<headline>Croatian March real wages rise.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA NET WAGES		MARCH     FEBRUARY   MARCH 96</p>
<p> Nominal wages (HRK)	    2,271	2,196	1,920</p>
<p> -Goods, services sector	2,228	2,147	1,876</p>
<p> -Government services	   2,387	2,329	2,038</p>
<p> Real wage index (base 1996)  108.2	104.9	 94.7</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
